+/* Additive immutable Rust Engine options. Initialize every version header with
+ * sizeof(the structure) and OUI_ABI_VERSION. Initialization/query write only
+ * the v1 prefix, preserve larger caller tails and leave outputs untouched on
+ * error. Input configurations are copied and may be released after creation.
+ * Changes to input memory, viewport, styles or document state never change
+ * a live document's raster policy. Query returns owned fields, with no borrows.
+ * Presentation preference in OuiAppConfig is independent of raster policy.
+ * These calls do not inspect environment variables or initialize a GPU.
+ * Ganesh configuration requires an explicitly available Ganesh compositor;
+ * CPU replay rejects it. Direct Ganesh release qualification remains open.
+ * init owns no object and may run on any thread; other calls follow the normal
+ * owning-thread handle rules. Callbacks use the same retained Rust document.
+ */
